    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Sharp Type, independent digital type foundry founded 2015 by Lucas Sharp and Chantra Malee, New York-based (founders spent time in Granada, Spain; primary base US). Retail + custom typefaces; notable: Sharp Sans (Samsung), Sharp Grotesk (la Repubblica), Dropbox, Sharp Earth (multi-script), Sharp Serif. Feb 2024 sold 27 retail families to Monotype and now rebuilding the library while staying independent (Monotype creative partner). Established, well-regarded foundry, ~10 yrs. IG @sharp_type (47K, verified) + email info@sharptype.co from their site. Size 2-10 (small studio with an energized team per recent press).",
